{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371770/extras/20887079c45d464037da8f5ba24d2a88.poster.avif?t=1760620418\" width=800 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371770/extras/20887079c45d464037da8f5ba24d2a88.webm?t=1760620418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funguys Swarm is a survivor-style roguelite where you play as forest weirdos fighting the Fire King\u2019s flaming minions. Level up, unlock new heroes, pets, skills\u2014even mechas\u2014and rescue creatures to grow your Forest Sanctuary for permanent upgrades. Perfect for both newcomers and seasoned survivors!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371770/extras/2577796af82aab7b66c8e3d5da45f2ac.poster.avif?t=1760620418\" width=1170 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371770/extras/2577796af82aab7b66c8e3d5da45f2ac.webm?t=1760620418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a cast of silly funguys, each with their quirky charm and unique abilities. Whether you like getting up close and personal or prefer to keep things tactical from afar, there\u2019s a funguy for every playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371770/extras/76d72534777fec169d4517cb7445c83b.poster.avif?t=1760620418\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371770/extras/76d72534777fec169d4517cb7445c83b.webm?t=1760620418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against never-ending waves of flaming minions, mutated veggies, and things that probably shouldn\u2019t be on fire. The longer you last, the weirder\u2014and wilder\u2014it gets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371770/extras/85081df9b3ae021e7ea4093acaae6423.poster.avif?t=1760620418\" width=1170 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371770/extras/85081df9b3ae021e7ea4093acaae6423.webm?t=1760620418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab upgrades mid-run and stack chaotic, over-the-top powers that turn your goofy forest friend into a full-blown nature-powered menace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371770/extras/511c6ba8191855147aca257fcf03d7cc.poster.avif?t=1760620418\" width=1170 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371770/extras/511c6ba8191855147aca257fcf03d7cc.webm?t=1760620418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A weapon to surpass the m.... menace of the fire king! Powered by the forest and questionable engineering. It probably shouldn\u2019t work, but it does.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371770/extras/22eb334ea2f11f1c79ee08ef43a9a191.poster.avif?t=1760620418\" width=1170 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371770/extras/22eb334ea2f11f1c79ee08ef43a9a191.webm?t=1760620418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every now and then, the swarm throws a tantrum and sends in a giant boss. They're huge, unpredictable, and almost always on fire. Oh yeah, did I mention that there's even a bigger baddie at the end of each arena?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371770/extras/621c1396da59e080d43842fc0f505b2c.poster.avif?t=1760620418\" width=1170 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371770/extras/621c1396da59e080d43842fc0f505b2c.webm?t=1760620418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fret not, you have the forest backing you up in the Sanctuary, a place where you can upgrade your powers to be more ridiculous than it is right now... for the right price of course!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Initial early access release includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Biomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 Upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and many more we lost count</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3371770?t=1760620418","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3371770?t=1760620418","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371770/f8c9572a8754aec59636744abef77d6cdcbf2e11/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1760620418","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371770/f8c9572a8754aec59636744abef77d6cdcbf2e11/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1760620418","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Funguys Swarm x Coral Island</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371770/extras/b7757eded6aaf1855234c85ac6e91d20.avif?t=1760620418\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371770/extras_big/b7757eded6aaf1855234c85ac6e91d20.webp?t=1760620418 width=1600 height=900 /></span><br><br>To Celebrate the Early Access release of Funguys Swarm, we're excited to announce a <strong>special collaboration with Coral Island</strong>, featuring exclusive redeemable in-game goodies.<br><br>For every purchase of Funguys Swarm, you'll unlock these exclusive items in Coral Island:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fungarian Outfit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fungarian Chest &amp; Crafting Recipe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mythical Pet Outfit: Rusdy</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>Development Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371770/extras/ec17b1f6a6a46596843346c23e879750.avif?t=1760620418\" width=800 height=1805 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371770/extras/20887079c45d464037da8f5ba24d2a88.poster.avif?t=1760620418\" width=800 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371770/extras/20887079c45d464037da8f5ba24d2a88.webm?t=1760620418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funguys Swarm is a survivor-style roguelite where you play as forest weirdos fighting the Fire King\u2019s flaming minions. Level up, unlock new heroes, pets, skills\u2014even mechas\u2014and rescue creatures to grow your Forest Sanctuary for permanent upgrades. Perfect for both newcomers and seasoned survivors!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371770/extras/2577796af82aab7b66c8e3d5da45f2ac.poster.avif?t=1760620418\" width=1170 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371770/extras/2577796af82aab7b66c8e3d5da45f2ac.webm?t=1760620418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a cast of silly funguys, each with their quirky charm and unique abilities. Whether you like getting up close and personal or prefer to keep things tactical from afar, there\u2019s a funguy for every playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video cl